{"subject":"math3","year":2011,"count":23,"origin":"source","generator":"tools/work/build_analysis_from_blocks.py（source_blocks 原文照录，零编造）","analysis":[{"id":"math3-2011-1","num":1,"desc":"等价无穷小","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2011数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】（C）","【解析】法一：利用泰勒公式","$x\\to0$ 时，$\\sin x=x-\\dfrac{x^{3}}{3!}+o(x^{3})$，$\\sin 3x=3x-\\dfrac{27x^{3}}{3!}+o(x^{3})$","$\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{3\\sin x-\\sin 3x}{cx^{k}}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{-\\dfrac{x^{3}}{2}+\\dfrac{9x^{3}}{2}+o(x^{3})}{cx^{k}}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{4x^{3}}{cx^{k}}=1$","所以 $k=3,c=4$.","法二：利用洛必达法则和和差化积公式","$\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{3\\sin x-\\sin 3x}{cx^{k}}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{3\\cos x-3\\cos 3x}{ckx^{k-1}}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{3}{ck}\\dfrac{-2\\sin 2x\\sin(-x)}{x^{k-1}}=\\dfrac{12}{ck}\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{x^{2}}{x^{k-1}}=1$","所以 $k-1=2,ck=12$，即 $k=3,c=4$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2011-2","num":2,"desc":"导数定义","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2011数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】（B）","【解析】方法一：因为 $f(x)$ 在 $x=0$ 处可导，故","$I=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{x^{2}f(x)-2f(x^{3})}{x^{3}}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{x^{2}f(x)-x^{2}f(0)}{x^{3}}-\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{2f(x^{3})-2f(0)}{x^{3}}=f'(0)-2f'(0)=-f'(0)$","方法二：用泰勒展开式","$f(x)=f(0)+f'(0)x+o(x)=f'(0)x+o(x)$，","$f(x^{3})=f(0)+f'(0)x^{3}+o(x^{3})=f'(0)x^{3}+o(x^{3})$","$I=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{x^{2}f(x)-2f(x^{3})}{x^{3}}=\\dfrac{x^{2}\\left(f'(0)x+o(x)\\right)-2\\left(f'(0)x^{3}+o(x^{3})\\right)}{x^{3}}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{-f'(0)x^{3}+o(x^{3})}{x^{3}}=-f'(0)$"]}]},{"id":"math3-2011-3","num":3,"desc":"级数收敛的性质","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2011数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】（A）","【解析】$\\sum\\limits_{n=1}^{\\infty}u_{n}$ 收敛，则对它的任意项加括号后所成的级数仍收敛，故选项（A）正确，所以选（A）."]}]},{"id":"math3-2011-4","num":4,"desc":"定积分比较大小的性质","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2011数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】（B）","【解析】在区间 $\\left(0,\\dfrac{\\pi}{4}\\right)$ 上，$\\sin x<\\cos x<\\cot x$，且 $\\ln x$ 是增函数，所以","$\\ln(\\sin x)<\\ln(\\cos x)<\\ln(\\cot x)$","由定积分比较大小的性质可知，应选（B）."]}]},{"id":"math3-2011-5","num":5,"desc":"初等矩阵","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2011数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】（D）.","【解析】由初等变换及初等矩阵的性质易知 $\\boldsymbol{P}_{2}\\boldsymbol{A}\\boldsymbol{P}_{1}=\\boldsymbol{E}$，从而 $\\boldsymbol{A}=\\boldsymbol{P}_{2}^{-1}\\boldsymbol{P}_{1}^{-1}=\\boldsymbol{P}_{2}\\boldsymbol{P}_{1}^{-1}$，选（D）."]}]},{"id":"math3-2011-6","num":6,"desc":"非齐次线性方程组的通解","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2011数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】（C）.","【解析】由 $\\boldsymbol{\\eta}_{1},\\boldsymbol{\\eta}_{2},\\boldsymbol{\\eta}_{3}$ 是非齐次线性方程组 $\\boldsymbol{Ax}=\\boldsymbol{\\beta}$ 的三个线性无关的解，知 $\\boldsymbol{\\eta}_{3}-\\boldsymbol{\\eta}_{1},\\boldsymbol{\\eta}_{2}-\\boldsymbol{\\eta}_{1}$ 为 $\\boldsymbol{Ax}=\\boldsymbol{0}$ 的两个线性无关的解. 又由题设知矩阵 $\\boldsymbol{A}$ 的秩为 1，所以 $\\boldsymbol{Ax}=\\boldsymbol{0}$ 的基础解系包含$n-r(\\boldsymbol{A})=2$ 个向量，从而 $\\boldsymbol{\\eta}_{3}-\\boldsymbol{\\eta}_{1},\\boldsymbol{\\eta}_{2}-\\boldsymbol{\\eta}_{1}$ 为 $\\boldsymbol{Ax}=\\boldsymbol{0}$ 的一个基础解系. 另一方面，$\\dfrac{\\boldsymbol{\\eta}_{2}+\\boldsymbol{\\eta}_{3}}{2}$ 为 $\\boldsymbol{Ax}=\\boldsymbol{\\beta}$ 的解. 故由非齐次线性方程组解的结构，知 $\\dfrac{\\boldsymbol{\\eta}_{2}+\\boldsymbol{\\eta}_{3}}{2}+k_{1}(\\boldsymbol{\\eta}_{3}-\\boldsymbol{\\eta}_{1})+k_{2}(\\boldsymbol{\\eta}_{2}-\\boldsymbol{\\eta}_{1})$ 为$\\boldsymbol{Ax}=\\boldsymbol{\\beta}$ 的通解，故应选（C）."]}]},{"id":"math3-2011-7","num":7,"desc":"概率密度","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2011数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】（D）.","【解析】由概率密度的性质知，概率密度必须满足 $\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}f(x)dx=1$，故由题知","$\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}\\left[f_{1}(x)F_{2}(x)+f_{2}(x)F_{1}(x)\\right]dx=\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}dF_{1}(x)F_{2}(x)=F_{1}(x)F_{2}(x)\\Big|_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}=1$，","故选择（D）"]}]},{"id":"math3-2011-8","num":8,"desc":"泊松分布","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2011数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】（D）.","【解析】由题知 $EX_{i}=\\lambda,DX_{i}=\\lambda(i=1,2,\\cdots,n)$，故有","$ET_{1}=\\dfrac{1}{n}\\sum\\limits_{i=1}^{n}EX_{i}=\\lambda$，","$ET_{2}=\\dfrac{1}{n-1}\\sum\\limits_{i=1}^{n-1}EX_{i}+\\dfrac{1}{n}EX_{n}=\\lambda+\\dfrac{1}{n}\\lambda$","$DT_{1}=\\dfrac{1}{n^{2}}\\sum\\limits_{i=1}^{n}DX_{i}=\\dfrac{1}{n}\\lambda$","$DT_{2}=\\dfrac{1}{(n-1)^{2}}\\sum\\limits_{i=1}^{n-1}DX_{i}+\\dfrac{1}{n^{2}}DX_{n}=\\dfrac{1}{n-1}\\lambda+\\dfrac{1}{n^{2}}\\lambda$","由于 $\\dfrac{1}{n}<\\dfrac{1}{n-1}$，故有 $ET_{1}<ET_{2},DT_{1}<DT_{2}$，所以选择（D）"]}]},{"id":"math3-2011-9","num":9,"desc":"重要极限","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2011数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】$(1+3x)e^{3x}$","【解析】$f(x)=\\lim\\limits_{t\\to0}x(1+3t)^{\\frac{x}{t}}=x\\lim\\limits_{t\\to0}\\left[(1+3t)^{\\frac{1}{3t}}\\right]^{3x}=xe^{3x}$，则 $f'(x)=(1+3x)e^{3x}$"]}]},{"id":"math3-2011-10","num":10,"desc":"多元函数全微分","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2011数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】$(2\\ln2+1)\\mathrm{d}x+(-2\\ln2-1)\\mathrm{d}y$","【解析】$\\mathrm{d}z=\\dfrac{\\partial z}{\\partial x}\\mathrm{d}x+\\dfrac{\\partial z}{\\partial y}\\mathrm{d}y=(2\\ln2+1)\\mathrm{d}x-(2\\ln2+1)\\mathrm{d}y$","$\\dfrac{\\partial z}{\\partial x}\\Big|_{\\substack{x=1\\\\y=1}}=\\left(1+\\dfrac{x}{y}\\right)^{\\frac{x}{y}}\\left[\\dfrac{1}{y}\\ln\\left(1+\\dfrac{x}{y}\\right)+\\dfrac{x}{y}\\cdot\\dfrac{1}{1+\\dfrac{x}{y}}\\cdot\\dfrac{1}{y}\\right]\\Bigg|_{\\substack{x=1\\\\y=1}}=2\\ln2+1$，","$\\dfrac{\\partial z}{\\partial y}\\Big|_{\\substack{x=1\\\\y=1}}=\\left(1+\\dfrac{x}{y}\\right)^{\\frac{x}{y}}\\left[-\\dfrac{x}{y^{2}}\\ln\\left(1+\\dfrac{x}{y}\\right)+\\dfrac{x}{y}\\cdot\\dfrac{1}{1+\\dfrac{x}{y}}\\cdot\\left(-\\dfrac{x}{y^{2}}\\right)\\right]\\Bigg|_{\\substack{x=1\\\\y=1}}=-1-2\\ln2$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2011-11","num":11,"desc":"隐函数求导","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2011数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】$y=-2x$","【解析】等式两边同时求导数，$\\sec^{2}\\left(x+y+\\dfrac{\\pi}{4}\\right)(1+y')=e^{y}y'$，代入 $(0,0)$ 得到 $y'(0)=-2$，","所以切线方程为 $y=-2x$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2011-12","num":12,"desc":"旋转体体积","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2011数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】$\\dfrac{4}{3}\\pi$","【解析】$V=\\int_{1}^{2}\\pi y^{2}dx=\\int_{1}^{2}\\pi(x-1)^{2}dx=\\dfrac{4}{3}\\pi$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2011-13","num":13,"desc":"二次型标准形","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2011数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】$3y_{1}^{2}$.","【解析】由 $\\boldsymbol{A}$ 的各行元素之和为 3，得 $\\boldsymbol{A}\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}=3\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}$，从而 3 为其特征值.","因为 $r(\\boldsymbol{A})=1$，故 $\\boldsymbol{A}$ 的特征值为 0、0、1.","因此 $f$ 在正交变换 $\\boldsymbol{x}=\\boldsymbol{Qy}$ 下的标准形为 $3y_{1}^{2}$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2011-14","num":14,"desc":"二维正态分布","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2011数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】$\\mu(\\mu^{2}+\\sigma^{2})$","【解析】由题知 $X$ 与 $Y$ 的相关系数 $\\rho_{XY}=0$，即 $X$ 与 $Y$ 不相关.","当 $(X,Y)$ 服从二维正态分布，$X$ 与 $Y$ 不相关 $\\Leftrightarrow$ $X$ 与 $Y$ 独立","所以 $X$ 与 $Y$ 独立，则有","$EX=EY=\\mu,DX=DY=\\sigma^{2}$","$EY^{2}=DY+(EY)^{2}=\\mu^{2}+\\sigma^{2}$","$E\\left(XY^{2}\\right)=EXEY^{2}=\\mu\\left(\\mu^{2}+\\sigma^{2}\\right)$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2011-15","num":15,"desc":"极限计算","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2011数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】法一：$\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{\\sqrt{1+2\\sin x}-x-1}{x\\ln(1+x)}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{\\sqrt{1+2\\sin x}-x-1}{x^{2}}$","$=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{\\cos x-\\sqrt{1+2\\sin x}}{2x\\sqrt{1+2\\sin x}}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{\\cos x-\\sqrt{1+2\\sin x}}{2x}$","$=\\dfrac{1}{2}\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\left(-\\sin x-\\dfrac{\\cos x}{\\sqrt{1+2\\sin x}}\\right)=-\\dfrac{1}{2}$","法二：$\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{\\sqrt{1+2\\sin x}-x-1}{x\\ln(1+x)}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{1+2\\sin x-(x+1)^{2}}{x^{2}\\left(\\sqrt{1+2\\sin x}+x+1\\right)}$","$=\\dfrac{1}{2}\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{2\\sin x-x^{2}-2x}{x^{2}}=-\\dfrac{1}{2}+\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{\\sin x-x}{x^{2}}=-\\dfrac{1}{2}+\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{\\cos x-1}{2x}=-\\dfrac{1}{2}$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2011-16","num":16,"desc":"多元复合函数二阶偏导数","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2011数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】令 $u=x+y,v=f(x,y)$，则","$\\dfrac{\\partial z}{\\partial x}=z_{u}'+z_{v}'v_{x}'$，$\\dfrac{\\partial^{2}z}{\\partial x\\partial y}=z_{uu}''+z_{uv}''v_{y}'+\\left(z_{vu}''+z_{vv}''v_{y}'\\right)v_{x}'+z_{v}'v_{xy}''$.","由于 $f(1,1)=2$ 是 $f(u,v)$ 的极值，$f_{u}'(1,1)=f_{v}'(1,1)=0$，","所以 $\\dfrac{\\partial^{2}z}{\\partial x\\partial y}\\Big|_{x=1,y=1}=f_{uu}''(2,2)+f_{v}'(2,2)f_{uv}''(1,1)$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2011-17","num":17,"desc":"不定积分换元法","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2011数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】令 $t=\\sqrt{x}$，则有","$\\int\\dfrac{\\arcsin\\sqrt{x}+\\ln x}{\\sqrt{x}}\\mathrm{d}x=\\int\\dfrac{\\arcsin t+2\\ln t}{t}2tdt=2\\int\\left(\\arcsin t+2\\ln t\\right)dt$","$=2t\\left(\\arcsin t+2\\ln t\\right)-2\\int t\\left(\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{1-t^{2}}}+\\dfrac{2}{t}\\right)dt$","$=2t\\left(\\arcsin t+2\\ln t\\right)-4t-2\\int\\dfrac{t}{\\sqrt{1-t^{2}}}dt$","$=2t\\left(\\arcsin t+2\\ln t\\right)-4t+\\int\\dfrac{\\mathrm{d}(1-t^{2})}{\\sqrt{1-t^{2}}}$","$=2t\\left(\\arcsin t+2\\ln t\\right)-4t+2\\sqrt{1-t^{2}}+C$","$=2\\sqrt{x}\\left(\\arcsin\\sqrt{x}+\\ln x\\right)-4\\sqrt{x}+2\\sqrt{1-x}+C$"]}]},{"id":"math3-2011-18","num":18,"desc":"方程根的个数","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2011数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【证明】设 $f(x)=4\\arctan x-x+\\dfrac{4\\pi}{3}-\\sqrt{3}$，$x\\in(-\\infty,+\\infty)$","令 $f'(x)=\\dfrac{3-x^{2}}{1+x^{2}}=0$，得 $x=\\pm\\sqrt{3}$.","当 $x\\in(-\\infty,-\\sqrt{3})$ 和 $(\\sqrt{3},+\\infty)$ 时，$f'(x)<0$，此时 $f(x)$ 在 $(-\\infty,-\\sqrt{3})$ 或 $(\\sqrt{3},+\\infty)$ 上单调递减；","当 $x\\in(-\\sqrt{3},\\sqrt{3})$ 时，$f'(x)>0$，此时 $f(x)$ 在 $(-\\sqrt{3},\\sqrt{3})$ 上单调递增.","由于 $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to-\\infty}f(x)=+\\infty$，$f(-\\sqrt{3})=0$，所以在区间 $(-\\infty,-\\sqrt{3}]$ 内 $f(x)$ 有唯一的零点 $x=-\\sqrt{3}$；","由于 $f(\\sqrt{3})=2\\left(\\dfrac{4\\pi}{3}-\\sqrt{3}\\right)>0$，$\\lim\\limits_{x\\to+\\infty}f(x)=-\\infty$，所以在区间 $(\\sqrt{3},+\\infty)$ 内 $f(x)$ 有唯一零点，","在 $(-\\sqrt{3},\\sqrt{3})$ 内都没有实根.","综上所述，方程恰有两个实根."]}]},{"id":"math3-2011-19","num":19,"desc":"二重积分","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2011数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】方程两端分别为","$\\iint\\limits_{D_{t}}f(t)\\mathrm{d}x\\mathrm{d}y=\\dfrac{1}{2}t^{2}f(t)$","$\\iint\\limits_{D_{t}}f'(x+y)\\mathrm{d}x\\mathrm{d}y=\\int_{0}^{t}\\mathrm{d}x\\int_{0}^{t-x}f'(x+y)\\mathrm{d}y=\\int_{0}^{t}[f(t)-f(x)]\\mathrm{d}x=tf(t)-\\int_{0}^{t}f(x)\\mathrm{d}x$","由题意知 $tf(t)-\\int_{0}^{t}f(x)dx=\\dfrac{1}{2}t^{2}f(t)$，","两边求导整理得 $(2-t)f'(t)=2f(t)$","解得 $f(t)=\\dfrac{C}{(2-t)^{2}}$（$C$ 为任意常数）","将 $f(0)=1$ 代入，得 $C=4$，所以 $f(t)=\\dfrac{4}{(2-t)^{2}}$，即 $f(x)=\\dfrac{4}{(2-x)^{2}}$，$x\\in[0,1]$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2011-20","num":20,"desc":"向量组的线性表示","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2011数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】(1) 易知 $\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{1},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{2},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{3}$ 线性无关，由其不能被 $\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{1},\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{2},\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{3}$ 线性表出，得到 $\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{1},\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{2},\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{3}$ 线性相关，从而 $r(\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{1},\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{2},\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{3})<3$.","由","$\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&3\\\\1&2&4\\\\1&3&a\\end{pmatrix}\\to\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&3\\\\0&1&1\\\\0&2&a-3\\end{pmatrix}\\to\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&1\\\\0&1&1\\\\0&0&a-5\\end{pmatrix}$","得 $a=5$.","(2) $(\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{1},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{2},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{3}:\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{1},\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{2},\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{3})=\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&1&1&1&3\\\\0&1&3&1&2&4\\\\1&1&5&1&3&5\\end{pmatrix}\\to\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&1&1&1&3\\\\0&1&3&1&2&4\\\\0&1&4&0&2&2\\end{pmatrix}$","$\\to\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&1&1&1&3\\\\0&1&3&1&2&4\\\\0&0&1&-1&0&-2\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&0&2&1&5\\\\0&1&0&4&2&10\\\\0&0&1&-1&0&-2\\end{pmatrix}$","故 $\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{1}=2\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{1}+4\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{2}-\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{3}$，$\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{2}=\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{1}+2\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{2}$，$\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{3}=5\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{1}+10\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{2}-2\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{3}$"]}]},{"id":"math3-2011-21","num":21,"desc":"实对称矩阵特征值与特征向量","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2011数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】(1) 根据题意，$\\boldsymbol{A}\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}=-1\\times\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}$，$\\boldsymbol{A}\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}=1\\times\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}$","所以特征值 $-1$ 对应的特征向量为 $k_{1}\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}$，特征值 1 对应的特征向量为 $k_{2}\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}$.","由 $r(\\boldsymbol{A})=2$ 知 $\\boldsymbol{A}$ 的另一个特征值为 0，设特征值为 0 对应的特征向量为 $k_{3}\\begin{pmatrix}x_{1}\\\\x_{2}\\\\x_{3}\\end{pmatrix}$.","因为实对称矩阵不同特征值得特征向量正交，得到 $\\begin{cases}x_{1}-x_{3}=0\\\\x_{1}+x_{3}=0\\end{cases}$","从而特征值 0 对应的特征向量为 $k_{3}\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\1\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}$，其中 $k_{1},k_{2},k_{3}$ 为不为零的任意常数.","(2) 令 $\\boldsymbol{P}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&0\\\\0&0&1\\\\-1&1&0\\end{pmatrix}$，则 $\\boldsymbol{P}^{-1}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&0\\\\0&0&1\\\\-1&1&0\\end{pmatrix}^{-1}=\\begin{pmatrix}\\dfrac{1}{2}&0&-\\dfrac{1}{2}\\\\\\dfrac{1}{2}&0&\\dfrac{1}{2}\\\\0&1&0\\end{pmatrix}$","由 $\\boldsymbol{P}^{-1}\\boldsymbol{AP}=\\boldsymbol{\\Lambda}$，知","$\\boldsymbol{A}=\\boldsymbol{P\\Lambda P}^{-1}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&0\\\\0&0&1\\\\-1&1&0\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}-1&0&0\\\\0&1&0\\\\0&0&0\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&0\\\\0&0&1\\\\-1&1&0\\end{pmatrix}^{-1}=\\begin{pmatrix}0&0&1\\\\0&0&0\\\\1&0&0\\end{pmatrix}$"]}]},{"id":"math3-2011-22","num":22,"desc":"二维离散型随机变量的联合分布","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2011数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】（Ⅰ）由于 $P\\{X^{2}=Y^{2}\\}=1$，即","$P\\{X=0,Y=0\\}+P\\{X=1,Y=-1\\}+P\\{X=1,Y=1\\}=1$","则有","$P\\{X=1,Y=0\\}=P\\{X=0,Y=-\\}1=P\\{X=0,Y=1\\}=0$","$P\\{X=0,Y=0\\}=P\\{Y=0\\}-P\\{X=1,Y=0\\}=\\dfrac{1}{3}$","$P\\{X=1,Y=-1\\}=P\\{Y=-1\\}-P\\{X=0,Y=-1\\}=\\dfrac{1}{3}$","$P\\{X=1,Y=1\\}=P\\{Y=1\\}-P\\{X=0,Y=1\\}=\\dfrac{1}{3}$","所以 $(X,Y)$ 的概率分布为","$X=0$：$0$，$\\dfrac{1}{3}$，$0$；$X=1$：$\\dfrac{1}{3}$，$0$，$\\dfrac{1}{3}$（列 $Y$：$-1$，$0$，$1$）","（Ⅱ）易知随机变量 $Z$ 的可能取值为 $-1,0,1$，则有","$P\\{Z=1\\}=P\\{X=1,Y=1\\}=\\dfrac{1}{3}$","$P\\{Z=-1\\}=P\\{X=1,Y=-1\\}=\\dfrac{1}{3}$","$P\\{Z=0\\}=1-P\\{Z=1\\}-P\\{Z=-1\\}=\\dfrac{1}{3}$","故 $Z=XY$ 的概率分布为","$Z$：$-1$，$0$，$1$；$P$：$\\dfrac{1}{3}$，$\\dfrac{1}{3}$，$\\dfrac{1}{3}$","（Ⅲ）由（Ⅰ）和（Ⅱ）知","$E(XY)=EZ=(-1)\\times\\dfrac{1}{3}+1\\times\\dfrac{1}{3}=0$","$EX=\\dfrac{2}{3}$，$EY=(-1)\\times\\dfrac{1}{3}+1\\times\\dfrac{1}{3}=0$","故有 $Cov(X,Y)=E(XY)-EXEY=0$，所以 $\\rho_{XY}=0$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2011-23","num":23,"desc":"均匀分布","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2011数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】由题知二维随机变量 $(X,Y)$ 的概率密度函数为","$f(x,y)=\\begin{cases}1,(x,y)\\in G\\\\0,(x,y)\\notin G\\end{cases}$","（Ⅰ）由边缘密度的定义知","当 $0<x\\leqslant1$ 时，有 $f_{x}(x)=\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}f(x,y)\\mathrm{d}y=\\int_{0}^{x}\\mathrm{d}y=x$，","当 $1<x<2$ 时，有 $f_{x}(x)=\\int_{0}^{2-x}\\mathrm{d}y=2-x$，","所以 $f_{x}(x)=\\begin{cases}x,&0<x\\leqslant1\\\\2-x,&1<x<2\\\\0,&\\text{其他}\\end{cases}$","（Ⅱ）同（Ⅰ）可得","当 $0<y<1$ 时，有 $f_{y}(y)=\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}f(x,y)\\mathrm{d}x=\\int_{y}^{2-y}\\mathrm{d}x=2(1-y)$","所以 $f_{y}(y)=\\begin{cases}2(1-y),&0<y<1\\\\0,&\\text{其他}\\end{cases}$","当 $0<y<1$ 时","$f_{X|Y}(x|y)=\\dfrac{f(x,y)}{f_{y}(y)}=\\begin{cases}\\dfrac{1}{2(1-y)},&(x,y)\\in G\\\\0,&(x,y)\\notin G\\end{cases}$."]}]}]}